  "details": "listen. i understand VR and games dev isnt easy. im a 3d artist and work with devs.\nbut today i was aprouched by what sounds like a 14-15 years old kid.\nhe changed every avatar on the map crashing allot of people.\ntalked in a VARRRRY \"bad\" way to say the least to me.\neven tho every one in the room vote kicked him he wasent able to be kicked,\nand u know what worse? he told me what country im from and whats my ip.\nKNOW WHAT WORST? IS A TRUSTED USER! so either he been doing this for a long time\nor this is another unsecure thing that easy to hack.\nits 1 thing a crashing avatar some1 puts and goes into a game.\nbut THIS IS NOT A THING THAT MAKES SENSE.\nhe knows my IP! he can ddos me at any moment. he got it from your unsecure game!\nthe game that has this issues from day 1 and that either u dont cant or dont care to fix.\nby this point if there was a diffrent game that let me do what this game does i would run away to it faster then you think. SADLY. and i say sadly because i mean it. your our only option.\nso please FIX THOSE SECTURITY FLAWS. my info isnt suppose to go to a 15 years with a keyboard because u cant secure a game.",
